  "body": "Brand-new, street-front freehold living in St Heliers, with independent access, doorstep parking and two sought-after Glendowie school zones.\r\nLast one remaining! Don't miss this final opportunity to secure your place in this boutique development.\r\n\r\n*  Prime street-front position with independent access - no shared driveway\r\n*  Zoned for Glendowie School  and Glendowie College \r\n*  Freehold title - 101sqm land, approximately 96sqm floor area\r\n*  3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms \r\n*  Dedicated off-street parking right at your doorstep\r\n*  Modern kitchen featuring Bosch appliances\r\n*  Light-filled open-plan living with easy outdoor flow\r\n*  Brand-new, low-maintenance living - ready to enjoy\r\n\r\nDocuments Download: https://tinyurl.com/16emerson \r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of arriving directly at your own front door, with a thoughtfully designed home offering comfort, practicality and effortless everyday living.\r\n\r\nFor families, the education advantage is a standout. With Glendowie School and Glendowie College zoning, your children's schooling is well catered for from primary through to secondary years.\r\n\r\nBeyond your doorstep, discover the lifestyle that makes the Eastern Bays so desirable. St Heliers Village, beautiful beaches, waterfront cafes, parks and everyday amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, growing your family or downsizing without compromising on location, this is your final chance to make this brand-new St Heliers home yours. Don't miss out!\r\n\r\nContact Roman Hu at 021 590 027 for viewing. Conjunctional sales are welcome.",
